(1381, 1, '2025-03-31 02:52:51', '2025-03-31 00:52:51', '<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<p>Vous avez une question, une suggestion ou besoin d’une assistance ? Notre équipe est à votre écoute et prête à vous accompagner. Nous nous engageons à vous répondre dans les plus brefs délais afin de vous offrir la meilleure expérience possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<p>Que ce soit pour une demande d’information, une collaboration ou un retour d’expérience, n’hésitez pas à nous écrire via le formulaire ci-dessous. Nous accordons une grande importance à vos retours et mettons tout en œuvre pour améliorer continuellement nos services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<p>Remplissez simplement les champs requis et nous reviendrons vers vous dès que possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"categories\":[\"contact\"],\"patternName\":\"twentytwentyfive/contact-centered-social-link\",\"name\":\"Liens centrés et liens sociaux\"},\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"},\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"1340px\",\"contentSize\":\"645px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:wpforms/form-selector {\"clientId\":\"6a0934f1-66ad-457f-a6da-19273a87006d\",\"formId\":\"376\",\"theme\":\"default-copy-1\",\"themeName\":\"Default (Copie)\",\"labelColor\":\"#29354c\",\"labelSublabelColor\":\"#29354c\",\"customCss\":\".form-contact form{\\ndisplay:flex;\\nflex-direction:column;\\nalign-items:center;\\njustify-content:center;\\n}\\n.form-newletters .wpforms-field {\\ndisplay:inline-flex;\\nalign-items:center;\\n}\\n\\n.form-contact form .wpforms-field-label{\\nmargin-left: 0 !important;\\n}\\n\\n.form-contact form input{\\nmin-width:100%;\\n}\\n\\n.form-contact .wpforms-field .wpforms-field-label{\\nmargin:10px;\\ncolor:#3A2A1D;\\n}\\n\\n.btn-contact{\\nmargin : auto;\\n}\",\"copyPasteJsonValue\":\"{\\u0022displayTitle\\u0022:false,\\u0022displayDesc\\u0022:false,\\u0022theme\\u0022:\\u0022default-copy-1\\u0022,\\u0022themeName\\u0022:\\u0022Default (Copie)\\u0022,\\u0022fieldSize\\u0022:\\u0022medium\\u0022,\\u0022backgroundImage\\u0022:\\u0022none\\u0022,\\u0022backgroundPosition\\u0022:\\u0022center center\\u0022,\\u0022backgroundRepeat\\u0022:\\u0022no-repeat\\u0022,\\u0022backgroundSizeMode\\u0022:\\u0022cover\\u0022,\\u0022backgroundSize\\u0022:\\u0022cover\\u0022,\\u0022backgroundWidth\\u0022:\\u0022100px\\u0022,\\u0022backgroundHeight\\u0022:\\u0022100px\\u0022,\\u0022backgroundUrl\\u0022:\\u0022url()\\u0022,\\u0022backgroundColor\\u0022:\\u0022rgba( 0, 0, 0, 0 )\\u0022,\\u0022fieldBorderRadius\\u0022:\\u00223px\\u0022,\\u0022fieldBorderStyle\\u0022:\\u0022solid\\u0022,\\u0022fieldBorderSize\\u0022:\\u00221px\\u0022,\\u0022fieldBackgroundColor\\u0022:\\u0022#f7f1eb\\u0022,\\u0022fieldBorderColor\\u0022:\\u0022#29354c\\u0022,\\u0022fieldTextColor\\u0022:\\u0022#29354c\\u0022,\\u0022fieldMenuColor\\u0022:\\u0022#29354c\\u0022,\\u0022labelSize\\u0022:\\u0022medium\\u0022,\\u0022labelColor\\u0022:\\u0022#29354c\\u0022,\\u0022labelSublabelColor\\u0022:\\u0022#29354c\\u0022,\\u0022labelErrorColor\\u0022:\\u0022#d63637\\u0022,\\u0022buttonSize\\u0022:\\u0022medium\\u0022,\\u0022buttonBorderStyle\\u0022:\\u0022none\\u0022,\\u0022buttonBorderSize\\u0022:\\u00221px\\u0022,\\u0022buttonBorderRadius\\u0022:\\u00223px\\u0022,\\u0022buttonBackgroundColor\\u0022:\\u0022#15070f\\u0022,\\u0022buttonTextColor\\u0022:\\u0022#f7f1eb\\u0022,\\u0022buttonBorderColor\\u0022:\\u0022#066aab\\u0022,\\u0022pageBreakColor\\u0022:\\u0022#066aab\\u0022,\\u0022containerPadding\\u0022:\\u00220px\\u0022,\\u0022containerBorderStyle\\u0022:\\u0022none\\u0022,\\u0022containerBorderWidth\\u0022:\\u00221px\\u0022,\\u0022containerBorderColor\\u0022:\\u0022#000000\\u0022,\\u0022containerBorderRadius\\u0022:\\u00223px\\u0022,\\u0022containerShadowSize\\u0022:\\u0022none\\u0022,\\u0022customCss\\u0022:\\u0022.form-contact form{\\\\ndisplay:flex;\\\\nflex-direction:column;\\\\nalign-items:center;\\\\njustify-content:center;\\\\n}\\\\n.form-newletters .wpforms-field {\\\\ndisplay:inline-flex;\\\\nalign-items:center;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n.form-contact form .wpforms-field-label{\\\\nmargin-left: 0 !important;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n.form-contact form input{\\\\nmin-width:100%;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n.form-contact .wpforms-field .wpforms-field-label{\\\\nmargin:10px;\\\\ncolor:#3A2A1D;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n.btn-contact{\\\\nmargin : auto;\\\\n}\\u0022}\",\"fieldBackgroundColor\":\"#f7f1eb\",\"fieldBorderColor\":\"#29354c\",\"fieldTextColor\":\"#29354c\",\"fieldMenuColor\":\"#29354c\",\"buttonBackgroundColor\":\"#15070f\",\"buttonTextColor\":\"#f7f1eb\"} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>\n/* Style global du formulaire */\n.form-contact {\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background: #29354C;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n}\n\n/* Style des champs */\n.wpforms-field-container {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 15px;\n}\n\n/* Labels */\n.wpforms-field-label {\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #29354C;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n    display: block;\n}\n\n/* Inputs et Textarea */\n.wpforms-field input,\n.wpforms-field textarea {\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 12px;\n    border: 1px solid #F7F1EB;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.wpforms-field input:focus,\n.wpforms-field textarea:focus {\n    border-color: #D4A373;\n    outline: none;\n}\n\n/* Textarea spécifique */\n.wpforms-field textarea {\n    min-height: 120px;\n    resize: vertical;\n}\n\n/* Style des champs requis */\n.wpforms-required-label {\n    color: red;\n}\n\n/* Champ caché (protection antispam) */\n#wpforms-376-field_1-container {\n    display: none !important;\n}\n\n\n</style>\n<!-- /wp:html -->', 'Nous contacter', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '134-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-31 02:52:51', '2025-03-31 00:52:51', '', 134, 'http://localhost/DicoTrav/?p=1381', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
